Put a tooltip away at Escape

A key press hides a tooltip only for as long as the keyboard was the
last input: the next nudge of the pointer over the element shows it
again. Have Escape, pressed without modifiers, put away a tooltip that
is showing or waiting out its delay, as a press on its element does,
until the pointer leaves the element.

